+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fix a bug where escaped braces (``{{`` and ``}}``) in ``--msg-template`` were
+mistakenly interpreted as message fields and removed.
+
+Closes #7993
